        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerator Operator is cash chasing roguelike where you harness the power of the atom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch  neutrons to create a chain reaction splitting materials into more neutrons. The more neutrons the more money made!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different materials have vastly different effects when hit: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fissile materials will make more neutrons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiply neutrons and redirect them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase profits of neutrons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain perks with powerful synergies that gives you a unique experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges, starting materials, and persistent unlocks will make sure the experience always feels fresh and give a harder challenge for those who seek it.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerator Operator is cash chasing roguelike where you harness the power of the atom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch  neutrons to create a chain reaction splitting materials into more neutrons. The more neutrons the more money made!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different materials have vastly different effects when hit: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fissile materials will make more neutrons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiply neutrons and redirect them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase profits of neutrons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain perks with powerful synergies that gives you a unique experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges, starting materials, and persistent unlocks will make sure the experience always feels fresh and give a harder challenge for those who seek it.</p>",
        "short_description": "Build a chain reaction and watch it break apart for Profit! Accelerator Operator is cash chasing roguelike where you harness the power of the atom. Play through 4 difficulties with 8 element types built to provide challenge to those of any skill level.",
